        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bushidon't is a tight, skill-first 4-lane rhythm game where pixel samurai clash to your timing. Feel every slice with responsive inputs and charts designed for clarity and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132880/extras/1399bf08251063e6a4ce574c95527ef4.avif?t=1763756183\" width=473 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons run on a fixed, predictable schedule. Every two months, a new Season adds 6 permanent tracks as a free update to the base game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each Season, leaderboards reset. New players get a fair shot at the top, and veterans race for glory on a clean slate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip a Season and you lose nothing. Come back any time and compete on both new and old tracks at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132880/extras/2aec5a12e718a0b886ddf0595cfeb558.avif?t=1763756183\" width=664 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All tracks are unlocked from day one. No grind, no gating—just jump in and play what you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No gameplay DLC or season pass required. Seasonal content is free; the only optional purchase is each Season’s soundtrack (OST) for $2 with no in-game effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo-dev project. Six tracks per Season keeps quality high and promises realistic. Over time, that adds up to a big, satisfying library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, responsive 4-lane rhythm gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive pixel samurai battles in the background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed two-month Seasons with +6 permanent tracks each</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal leaderboard resets for fair competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All content unlocked from the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No extra purchase required for seasonal content; optional $2 OST only</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bushidon't is a tight, skill-first 4-lane rhythm game where pixel samurai clash to your timing. Feel every slice with responsive inputs and charts designed for clarity and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132880/extras/1399bf08251063e6a4ce574c95527ef4.avif?t=1763756183\" width=473 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons run on a fixed, predictable schedule. Every two months, a new Season adds 6 permanent tracks as a free update to the base game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each Season, leaderboards reset. New players get a fair shot at the top, and veterans race for glory on a clean slate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip a Season and you lose nothing. Come back any time and compete on both new and old tracks at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132880/extras/2aec5a12e718a0b886ddf0595cfeb558.avif?t=1763756183\" width=664 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All tracks are unlocked from day one. No grind, no gating—just jump in and play what you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No gameplay DLC or season pass required. Seasonal content is free; the only optional purchase is each Season’s soundtrack (OST) for $2 with no in-game effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo-dev project. Six tracks per Season keeps quality high and promises realistic. Over time, that adds up to a big, satisfying library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, responsive 4-lane rhythm gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive pixel samurai battles in the background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed two-month Seasons with +6 permanent tracks each</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal leaderboard resets for fair competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All content unlocked from the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No extra purchase required for seasonal content; optional $2 OST only</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Slice to the beat in a 4‑lane rhythm challenge where pixel samurai clash in stylish duels. Nail perfect hits, infinite combos, and watch the battlefield react to your groove. Sharpen your senses, master the rhythm, and win honor one note at a time.",
